{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "FEMO 网页版",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "key": "",
  "description": "把各家 AI 官网（chat.deepseek.com、chatglm.cn、www.doubao.com、www.kimi.com、chatgpt.com、aistudio.google.com、grok.com、www.qianwen.com）的会话标签页接入 FEMO：上报会话身份、按席位下发 FEMO 任务并写入输入框、收整段回复交回本地服务。",
  "$comment": "清单住适配器根：chrome://extensions 直接加载 webAdapter/ 本身（与 dsh 插件根同一取态）；代码文件全在 extension/ 与站点包（sites/chat.deepseek.com/ 等），路径键从这里指过去。server/·tests/·console/·shared/ 会随包带上，解压加载无碍。key=扩展 ID 钉死（2026-09-29 一键连接改版）：未打包扩展的 ID 本按所在文件夹路径散列、换机器/换文件夹就变，导致原生宿主登记永远慢一拍；改用固定 RSA 公钥派生，任何机器任何浏览器（Chrome/Edge）都是同一个 ID（chnopknlljbmbbfihgbbnjacleomaopn），本地服务启动时的自动登记才能一步锁准。key 一动 ID 就变——所有已装机器须重载扩展（服务下次启动会自动按新 ID 重登记，幂等）。matches 与 host_permissions 是各站点包 site.mjs 的登记镜像（静态 JSON 进不了 ESM），改站两处同改。各站 content.js 条目前置 extension/seat-agent-core.js（座席机器骨架唯一一份，经典脚本按序注入同一隔离世界），改骨架只动它。悬浮球段=机器公共 UI 的在役站点登记（取证站点不挂）。在役站点：chat.deepseek.com、chatglm.cn、www.doubao.com（2026-09-27 当日转正）、www.kimi.com（2026-09-28 三轮探针取证当日转正）、chatgpt.com（2026-09-29 一轮探针取证当日转正）、aistudio.google.com（2026-09-29 四轮仪表取证当日转正）、grok.com（2026-09-29 四轮探针取证当日转正——补全走 WebSocket，闸包装 WS 构造器；思考可见照收）、www.qianwen.com（2026-09-29 六轮探针取证当日转正——思考 bar_thinking/正文 multi_load/iframe 双快照覆盖式，均照收）。externally_connectable=操作台页对扩展的唯一发信口（web-set-server：服务挪窝时一键告知新地址，2026-09-28 地址设置自侧栏搬入操作台）。",
  "permissions": ["tabs", "storage", "sidePanel", "alarms", "nativeMessaging", "scripting", "notifications"],
  "host_permissions": ["https://chat.deepseek.com/*", "https://chatglm.cn/*", "https://www.doubao.com/*", "https://www.kimi.com/*", "https://chatgpt.com/*", "https://aistudio.google.com/*", "https://grok.com/*", "https://www.qianwen.com/*", "http://127.0.0.1/*"],
  "externally_connectable": { "matches": ["http://127.0.0.1/*", "http://localhost/*"] },
  "background": { "service_worker": "extension/background.js", "type": "module" },
  "action": {
    "default_title": "FEMO 灵魂面板",
    "default_icon": {
      "16": "extension/icons/icon16.png",
      "32": "extension/icons/icon32.png",
      "48": "extension/icons/icon48.png",
      "128": "extension/icons/icon128.png"
    }
  },
  "icons": {
    "16": "extension/icons/icon16.png",
    "32": "extension/icons/icon32.png",
    "48": "extension/icons/icon48.png",
    "128": "extension/icons/icon128.png"
  },
  "side_panel": { "default_path": "extension/sidepanel.html" },
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": ["https://chat.deepseek.com/*"],
      "js": ["sites/chat.deepseek.com/inject.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chat.deepseek.com/*"],
      "js": ["extension/bubble.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chat.deepseek.com/*"],
      "js": ["extension/seat-agent-core.js", "sites/chat.deepseek.com/content.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chatglm.cn/*"],
      "js": ["sites/chatglm.cn/inject.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chatglm.cn/*"],
      "js": ["extension/bubble.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chatglm.cn/*"],
      "js": ["extension/seat-agent-core.js", "sites/chatglm.cn/content.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://www.doubao.com/*"],
      "js": ["sites/www.doubao.com/inject.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://www.doubao.com/*"],
      "js": ["extension/bubble.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://www.doubao.com/*"],
      "js": ["extension/seat-agent-core.js", "sites/www.doubao.com/content.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://www.kimi.com/*"],
      "js": ["sites/www.kimi.com/inject.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://www.kimi.com/*"],
      "js": ["extension/bubble.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://www.kimi.com/*"],
      "js": ["extension/seat-agent-core.js", "sites/www.kimi.com/content.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chatgpt.com/*"],
      "js": ["sites/chatgpt.com/inject.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN"
    },
    {
      "matches": ["https://chatgpt.com/*"],
